@startuml
!include theme.iuml
title AnimeLab — orchestration des téléchargements et bibliothèque
' @source animelab/services/download_manager.py:DownloadManagerService
' @source animelab/services/download_manager.py:ResolvedVideoInfo
' @source animelab/services/library_service.py:LibraryService
' @source animelab/services/verification_service.py:DownloadVerificationService
' @source animelab/services/verification_service.py:VerificationResult
' @source animelab/services/watchdog_service.py:WatchdogService
' @source animelab/media_tools.py:run
' @source animelab/platform_events.py:completed
' @source animelab/services/download_stages/transfer.py:TransferWorker
' @source animelab/services/download_stages/media.py:MediaPipeline
' @source animelab/services/download_stages/export.py:ExportCoordinator
' @source animelab/services/download_stages/scheduler.py:DownloadScheduler
' @source animelab/services/download_stages/budget.py:StageBudget
' @source animelab/services/download_stages/state.py:transition
package "Services partagés Python" {
  class DownloadManagerService {
    tasks: Dict[str, DownloadTask]
    task_order: List[str]
    max_concurrent_downloads: int
    +init_from_db()
    +start_download(...): DownloadTask
    +start_batch_download(...)
    +process_queue()
    +pause_download(task_id)
    +resume_download(task_id)
    +resume_verified_domain(domain)
    +cancel_download(task_id)
    +get_or_resolve_episode_info(...)
    +subscribe_sse()
    +broadcast_update(task)
    +export_task(task, manual=false)
    -_execute_download(task)
    -_finalize_task(task)
    -_publish_mux_file(...)
  }
  class LibraryService {
    +save_task(task)
    +get_unfinished_tasks()
    +find_downloaded_episode(...)
    +add_favorite(...)
    +mark_as_downloaded(...)
    +mark_as_watched(...)
    +get_history(...)
    +discover_auto_episodes(...)
    +attach_auto_download_task(...)
    +recover_interrupted_exports()
  }
  class WatchdogService {
    interval: int
    +start()
    +stop()
    +check_new_episodes(): int
    -_check_anime(fav)
  }
  class DownloadVerificationService {
    +verify_file(...): VerificationResult
  }
  class VerificationResult <<Pydantic>> {
    valid: bool
    status: str
    error: Optional[str]
    duration: Optional[float]
    relocatedPath: Optional[str]
  }
  class ResolvedVideoInfo {
    direct_url: str
    subtitles_json: str
    server_type: str
    selected_server: str
    selected_quality: str
    size: int
  }
  class "media_tools" as MediaTools <<module>> {
    +run(args, ...)
    +which(name)
    +decrypt_aes_cbc(...)
    +configure_android(media, aes)
  }
  class "platform_events" as PlatformEvents <<module callbacks>> {
    progress_handler
    completed_handler
    storage_status_handler
    storage_action_handler
    +progress(task)
    +completed(task)
  }
}
class TransferWorker {
  +_execute_download(task)
  +_download_single_file(task, url)
  +_download_hls_segments_native(task, url)
}
class MediaPipeline {
  +assemble_hls(...)
  +assemble_chunks(...)
  +_finalize_task(task)
}
class ExportCoordinator {
  +export_task(task, manual=false)
}
class DownloadScheduler {
  workers: dict
  network_tasks: set
  +process_queue()
  +release_network(task_id)
  +close()
}
class StageBudget {
  limit: int
  active: int
  +run(task, jobs, function, ...)
}
DownloadManagerService *-- TransferWorker
DownloadManagerService *-- MediaPipeline
DownloadManagerService *-- ExportCoordinator
DownloadManagerService *-- DownloadScheduler
MediaPipeline *-- StageBudget : budget média
ExportCoordinator *-- StageBudget : budget publication
TransferWorker ..> MediaPipeline : assemblage / finalisation
MediaPipeline ..> ExportCoordinator : média vérifié
MediaPipeline ..> DownloadScheduler : libère le réseau
class DownloadTask
class DownloadTaskEntity
class ExtractorRegistry
class SourceCatalogueService {
  +provider(source_id)
}
DownloadManagerService "1" o-- "0..*" DownloadTask : tasks (index en mémoire)
DownloadManagerService ..> LibraryService : sauvegarde / restauration
LibraryService ..> DownloadTaskEntity : conversion / transactions ORM
DownloadManagerService ..> ResolvedVideoInfo : résolution des lecteurs
DownloadManagerService ..> ExtractorRegistry : extractions dédiées puis repli
DownloadManagerService ..> DownloadVerificationService : vérifie média local
DownloadVerificationService ..> VerificationResult : produit
DownloadVerificationService ..> MediaTools : FFprobe + décodage FFmpeg
DownloadManagerService ..> MediaTools : AES / remux / sous-titres
DownloadManagerService ..> PlatformEvents : notification / export natif
WatchdogService ..> LibraryService : favoris autoDownload
WatchdogService ..> SourceCatalogueService : choisir le fournisseur exact
WatchdogService ..> DownloadManagerService : planification / nouvelles tâches
note bottom of WatchdogService
SourceCatalogueService.provider() délègue au SourceRegistry
et sélectionne la source
intégrée ou l'extension activée. Source, URL, version et
préférences accompagnent chaque nouvelle tâche.
Le registre persistant sépare découverte et résultat.
end note
note bottom of PlatformEvents
Pas de classe abstraite PlatformAdapter aujourd'hui.
Callbacks configurés par android_runtime.py ;
la façade media_tools utilise subprocess sur bureau,
et les ponts JNI sur Android.
end note
@enduml
